1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,188
Step out.

2
00:00:01,188 --> 00:00:02,076
Look closer.

3
00:00:02,076 --> 00:00:08,736
Wildmon turns a walk outside into a nature discovery game, one real observation at a

4
00:00:08,736 --> 00:00:09,180
time.

5
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:12,134
Start with a quick capture.

6
00:00:12,134 --> 00:00:17,085
Choose a clear photo of one plant, bird, or insect, then submit it.

7
00:00:17,085 --> 00:00:21,655
Identification runs in the background, so you can put your phone away.

8
00:00:21,655 --> 00:00:23,940
Here's an earlier, genuinely processed discovery.

9
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:28,129
Verified results join your collection and earn experience points; uncertainty stays

10
00:00:28,129 --> 00:00:28,510
visible.

11
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:35,133
Want a little more structure?

12
00:00:35,133 --> 00:00:38,178
Pick a ten, twenty, or thirty minute hunt.

13
00:00:38,178 --> 00:00:41,604
Start the timer, explore, and finish when you're ready.

14
00:00:41,604 --> 00:00:45,030
Your summary brings the session's discoveries and rewards together.

15
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:50,564
Friend challenges give two explorers the same targets.

16
00:00:50,564 --> 00:00:53,065
Choose supported categories or visual traits.

17
00:00:53,065 --> 00:00:58,066
Both players must be ready before the server starts one shared clock.

18
00:00:58,066 --> 00:01:00,150
Verified evidence decides the result.

19
00:01:01,230 --> 00:01:04,515
Ecosystem packs turn discoveries into a lasting checklist.

20
00:01:04,515 --> 00:01:09,443
Progress carries across days, and earlier verified observations can count when you

21
00:01:09,443 --> 00:01:09,854
join.

22
00:01:09,854 --> 00:01:13,550
Each photograph fills one matching slot in a pack.

23
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:19,517
Earn badges, build your collection, and compare server-awarded experience on weekly

24
00:01:19,517 --> 00:01:20,857
or all-time leaderboards.

25
00:01:20,857 --> 00:01:24,880
The reward is noticing more of the living world.

26
00:01:25,930 --> 00:01:27,785
Behind the scenes, Next.

27
00:01:27,785 --> 00:01:30,566
js connects to a FastAPI backend.

28
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:34,275
MongoDB Atlas stores discoveries and durable processing jobs.

29
00:01:34,275 --> 00:01:38,912
A separate Python worker asks Gemma to examine each image.

30
00:01:38,912 --> 00:01:43,548
Pydantic validates the response, and server rules award rewards once.

31
00:01:43,548 --> 00:01:46,794
Processing continues after you leave the page.

32
00:01:47,380 --> 00:01:49,076
A quick photo.

33
00:01:49,076 --> 00:01:50,772
A shared adventure.

34
00:01:50,772 --> 00:01:53,599
A growing connection with nature.

35
00:01:53,599 --> 00:01:54,164
Wildmon.

36
00:01:54,164 --> 00:01:55,860
Find more outside.

